---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---
<Layout title="Investor Tools | broker pal" description="Explore free broker pal tools for rental property analysis, DSCR estimates, property research, and loan quote comparisons.">
<section class="tools-page">
  <p class="kicker">BROKER PAL INVESTOR TOOLKIT</p>
  <h1>Tools for your next investment.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Explore practical tools to help you evaluate a property, understand a rental scenario, and compare financing options. Start with the information you have and use the results as a starting point for your research.</p>
  <div class="tool-grid">
    <a class="tool-card featured" href="/tools/property-report"><span class="tag">FREE · DOWNLOADABLE REPORT</span><h2>Property Data Report</h2><p>Research a property, review an estimated value when available, see comparable properties, add your own figures, and save or print your report as a PDF.</p><b>Create a property report <span>↗</span></b></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/tools/dscr-calculator"><span class="tag">PROPERTY CASH FLOW</span><h2>DSCR Calculator</h2><p>Estimate debt service coverage using rent, other income, operating expenses, and monthly debt service.</p><b>Calculate DSCR <span>↗</span></b></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/tools/loan-comparison"><span class="tag">COMPARE FINANCING</span><h2>Loan Comparison</h2><p>Compare two financing scenarios side by side, including estimated monthly principal and interest, closing costs, down payment, and prepayment penalty terms.</p><b>Compare loan options <span>↗</span></b></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/community"><span class="tag">INVESTOR CONNECTIONS</span><h2>Opportunity Circle</h2><p>Explore the Broker Pal community concept connecting real estate investors and professionals around opportunities and transactions.</p><b>Explore the community <span>↗</span></b></a>
  </div>
  <p class="disclaimer">These tools provide estimates and general property research, not an appraisal, rate quote, loan approval, or commitment to lend. Verify property details and financing terms independently.</p>
  <a class="back-link" href="/apply">Have a property in mind? Start a loan inquiry ↗</a>
</section>
</Layout>
<style>
.tools-page{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:55px 26px 80px;color:#20374e}.kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#078f9d;font-weight:800}.tools-page h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,56px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-1.8px;color:#102b49;margin:12px 0}.lead{max-width:760px;color:#63768a;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75}.tool-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin:34px 0}.tool-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;min-height:215px;padding:27px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce7eb;border-top:4px solid #079eaa;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 8px 24px #102b4908}.tool-card.featured{background:#edf6f6;border-top-color:#102b49}.tag{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:#078f9d}.tool-card h2{font-size:25px;color:#102b49;margin:13px 0 7px}.tool-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#63768a;margin:0 0 22px}.tool-card b{margin-top:auto;color:#078f9d;font-size:14px}.disclaimer{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#718295}.back-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;color:#078f9d;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:650px){.tool-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tools-page{padding:40px 20px 60px}}
</style>